        add("item.fargo_soul.terra_power.attribute.9", "Lightning increases crit by 10% (max 40%); max crit reduces bolt CD by 40%", "每发射一道闪电，持有者暴击率提升10%，最高提升40%暴击率，暴击率满时减少40%闪电发射冷却");
